msgid ""
"Starting with Qubes R3 we use `python unittest <https://docs.python.org/3/"
"library/unittest.html>`__ to perform automatic tests of Qubes OS. Despite "
"the name, we use it for both `unit tests <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Unit_tests>`__ and `integration tests <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Integration_tests>`__. The main purpose is, of course, to deliver much more "
"stable releases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/debugging/automated-tests.rst:12
#: e557108f7c8d4238b21db24d66b6e975
msgid ""
